e region or no longer available"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Confirm AMI ID, region, architecture, and owner"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-6",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"EC2 cannot be reached"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Route, public IP, security group, NACL, or host issue"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Check route table, address, security group, instance status, and OS firewall"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-7",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"SSH timeout"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Source IP not allowed or network route blocked"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Verify current public IP/CIDR and ingress rule"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-8",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"SSH permission denied"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Wrong user/key or unsupported auth setup"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Confirm AMI default username, key pair, file permissions, and access method"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-9",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Ansible host unreachable"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Inventory address or SSH connectivity is wrong"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":["Run ",["$","code","code-0",{"children":"ansible-inventory"}]," and test SSH separately"]}]]}],["$","tr","tr-10",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["Ansible ",["$","code","code-0",{"children":"sudo"}]," failure"]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"User cannot escalate privileges"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Confirm the intended user and become configuration"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-11",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Package task fails"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Distribution/package manager differs"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Check OS facts and package/service names"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-12",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Nginx not running"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Package/configuration error or service name mismatch"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":["Inspect ",["$","code","code-0",{"children":"systemctl status nginx"}]," and journal logs on the host"]}]]}],["$","tr","tr-13",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Webpage not reachable"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Nginx, security group, route, or target IP issue"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Check service status, port 80 rule, address, and local curl"}]]}],"$L110","$L111","$L112","$L113"]}]]}]
b8:["$","h3","h3-8",{"children":"Useful commands"}]
b9:["$","pre","pre-28",{"children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"language-bash","children":"# Terraform\r\nterraform fmt -recursive\r\nterraform validate\r\nterraform plan\r\nterraform state list\r\nterraform output\r\n\r\n# AWS identity and EC2 inspection\r\naws sts get-caller-identity\r\naws ec2 describe-instances --region ap-south-1\r\n\r\n# Ansible\r\nansible-inventory -i inventory/hosts.ini --list\r\nansible webservers -m ansible.builtin.ping\r\nansible-playbook -i inventory/hosts.ini playbooks/configure_web.yml --syntax-check\n"}]}]
ba:["$","p","p-43",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"children":"terraform state list"}]," and ",["$","code","code-1",{"children":"terraform output"}]," can reveal resource names or infrastructure details. Review their output before sharing it. Do not use ",["$","code","code-2",{"children":"terraform state rm"}]," as a routine troubleshooting command; it changes Terraform's tracking and does not delete the actual resource."]}]
